              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "હું આવતીકાલે લખીશ — hũ āvtīkāle lakhīś, I'll write tomorrow",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **હું આવતીકાલે લખીશ** — *hũ āvtīkāle lakhīś*, I'll write tomorrow]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "અમે ઘરે રહીશું — ame ghare rahīśũ, we'll stay at home",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **અમે ઘરે રહીશું** — *ame ghare rahīśũ*, we'll stay at home]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "અમે કાલે આવીશું — ame kāle āvīśũ, we'll come tomorrow",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **અમે કાલે આવીશું** — *ame kāle āvīśũ*, we'll come tomorrow]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "spoken": true,
              "id": "GU-C149-bolish-r1",
              "prompt": "Say that tomorrow you will speak Gujarati, then that we, you and I, will meet.",
              "assesses": [
                "GU-GRAMMAR-C149-ISH-01",
                "GU-GRAMMAR-C149-ISHUN-01"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 25,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "āvtīkāle hũ gujarātī bolīś; āpṇe maḷīśũ",
                "આવતીકાલે હું ગુજરાતી બોલીશ. આપણે મળીશું.",
                "āvtīkāle hũ gujarātī bolīś, āpṇe maḷīśũ"
              ],
              "feedback": {
