    {
      "id": "GU-C149-bolshe",
      "sequence": 7860,
      "title": "તે બોલશે — the future for everyone else",
      "headword": "…શે · …શો",
      "romanization": "-śe · -śo",
      "gloss": "he, she or they will, and you will: -śe and -śo",
      "script": "gujarati",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:bb102afdfddd56f1",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say I will speak Gujarati, then we'll meet tomorrow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: -શે",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તે આવતીકાલે આવશે. — te āvtīkāle āvśe. — He will come tomorrow. She will come tomorrow. તેઓ ગુજરાતી બોલશે. — teo gujarātī bolśe. — They will speak Gujarati."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "-શે sits on the bare stem, with no -ી- before it: બોલ-શે, આવ-શે."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: -શો",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તમે keeps the -ો it has in the present, બોલો છો:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તમે ક્યારે આવશો? — tame kyāre āvśo? — When will you come?"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The future for one person:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "headers": [
                "who",
                "will speak"
              ],
              "columns": 2,
              "rowCount": 2,
              "utterances": [
                "who: હું, તું. will speak: બોલીશ.",
                "who: તે. will speak: બોલશે."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "And for more than one, or for respect:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "table",
              "headers": [
                "who",
                "will speak"
              ],
              "columns": 2,
              "rowCount": 3,
              "utterances": [
                "who: અમે, આપણે. will speak: બોલીશું.",
                "who: તમે. will speak: બોલશો.",
                "who: તેઓ. will speak: બોલશે."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "te āvśe, then teo āvśe",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *te āvśe*, then *teo āvśe*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "ASK",
              "instruction": "tame kyāre āvśo?",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU ASK: *tame kyāre āvśo?*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "ANSWER",
              "instruction": "with હું … આવીશ — hũ … āvīś",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU ANSWER: with **હું … આવીશ** — *hũ … āvīś*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Which two persons share -શે? (તે and તેઓ.) What does તમે take? (-શો.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GU-C149-jaish",
      "sequence": 7870,
      "title": "જઈશ, થશે, હશે — the short verbs",
      "headword": "જઈશ · લઈશ · થશે · હશે",
      "romanization": "jaīś · laīś · thaśe · haśe",
      "gloss": "the short verbs in the future: go, take, do, happen, and be",
      "script": "gujarati",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:96d128ab3d13217e",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say she will come tomorrow, then ask when will you come? And two short verbs: જવું, to go, and લેવું, to take."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: જવું, લેવું, કરવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જવું and લેવું have short stems, and they put an ઈ where the long verbs have -ી-:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હું જઈશ — jaīś — I will go; અમે જઈશું; તે જશે; તમે જશો;"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હું લઈશ — laīś — I will take; તે લેશે."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કરવું is regular: હું કરીશ, અમે કરીશું, તે કરશે."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હું આવતીકાલે બજાર જઈશ. — hũ āvtīkāle bajār jaīś. — I'll go to the market tomorrow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: થશે and હશે",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "થવું, to happen, and હોવું, to be, are heard most often with -શે:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મોડું થશે. — moḍũ thaśe. — It will be late, word for word lateness will happen. તે ઘરે હશે. — te ghare haśe. — She will be at home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હશે is the future of છે: છે now, હતો before, હશે later. With તમે it is હશો: શું તમે ઘરે હશો?, will you be at home? Said about right now, હશે is a guess: તે ઘરે હશે can also mean she must be at home."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "hũ jaīś, te jaśe, tame jaśo",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *hũ jaīś*, *te jaśe*, *tame jaśo*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "હું દવા લઈશ — hũ davā laīś",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **હું દવા લઈશ** — *hũ davā laīś*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "સાંજે તેઓ ઘરે હશે — sānje teo ghare haśe",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **સાંજે તેઓ ઘરે હશે** — *sānje teo ghare haśe*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Which form is the future of છે? (હશે.) What do જવું and લેવું put before -શ? (ઈ: જઈશ, લઈશ.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
