      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say I will go, then it will be late."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ઊંઘ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઊંઘ (ūṅgh) — \"sleepiness, sleep\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Gujarati does not say I am sleepy. Sleep comes to you, the way a fever does:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મને ઊંઘ આવે છે. — mane ūṅgh āve che. — I'm sleepy. Word for word: to me, sleep comes. આજે રાત્રે સારી ઊંઘ આવશે. — āje rātre sārī ūṅgh āvśe. — Tonight there will be good sleep."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઊંઘ (ūṅgh) is feminine, so good bends to સારી. સૂવું, to sleep, is lying down to sleep; ઊંઘ (ūṅgh) is the sleep itself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઊંઘ (ūṅgh) is inherited. CDIAL reconstructs an Indo-Aryan uṅghā, \"sleep\", and lists the Gujarati word under it, beside Hindi ūṅgh (CDIAL 1633)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word, and sleep joins likes and fevers among the things that happen to someone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "ūṅgh",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ūṅgh*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "mane ūṅgh āve che",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *mane ūṅgh āve che*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "શું તમને ઊંઘ આવે છે? — śũ tamne ūṅgh āve che?, are you sleepy?",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **શું તમને ઊંઘ આવે છે?** — *śũ tamne ūṅgh āve che?*, are you sleepy?]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
