            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does ઊંઘ (ūṅgh) mean? (Sleepiness, sleep.) Which letter in it have you read but never written? (ઊ (ū), the next lesson.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
